n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kVcp6B8dzGYFGpFb9spMTyDnz0TzyM7Q?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TachibanaKoharu/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/968d23b2/uploads/origins/eee9e2ac-be11-4111-89ff-ba32222ff0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ee0dedaa67d78443c24ffaebd7dcd36", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/968d23b2/uploads/origins/eee9e2ac-be11-4111-89ff-ba32222ff0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ee0dedaa67d78443c24ffaebd7dcd36, https://si.imgix.net/968d23b2/uploads/origins/eee9e2ac-be11-4111-89ff-ba32222ff0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a8a5f2f9b4d877a7f7439726455eaa7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/968d23b2/uploads/origins/eee9e2ac-be11-4111-89ff-ba32222ff0b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76d59fa89c4eb9a3366d148a5065abae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールありがとうございます！\n普段VRChatというゲームで使用しているうちの子のイラストをお願いします！\nポーズや構図等はお任せします。\npsd形式で宛名等の差分をレイヤーで分けてもらえるとありがたいです。\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kS1Blc4xr2YrdLTCxQbP5Bmuow7vKKnT?usp=sharingp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TachibanaKoharu/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81bacdee/uploads/origins/4ec6fab6-f222-4b71-ba83-a456b3d0c5be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22d096e2b84aaefcd5234c5180e68558", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/81bacdee/uploads/origins/4ec6fab6-f222-4b71-ba83-a456b3d0c5be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22d096e2b84aaefcd5234c5180e68558, https://si.imgix.net/81bacdee/uploads/origins/4ec6fab6-f222-4b71-ba83-a456b3d0c5be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d2583b915491bfaad5ea59e47927cd9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/81bacdee/uploads/origins/4ec6fab6-f222-4b71-